{"duration_api_ms":59365,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"0204548c-a824-57b7-bea3-1783011bc81a","total_cost_usd":0.4025414,"usage":{"input_tokens":24,"cache_creation_input_tokens":23631,"cache_read_input_tokens":604987,"output_tokens":4620,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":385},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":23631,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1112,"cache_read_input_tokens":55344,"cache_creation_input_tokens":541,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":541},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":24,"outputTokens":4620,"cacheReadInputTokens":604987,"cacheCreationInputTokens":23631,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.4025414,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":385,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":23631,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":12,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"The two R2 rejections look like a false positive in the scope check. I couldn't fix that from inside this packet, so I recorded it and asked for a follow-up packet. The test repairs themselves are done and the acceptance command `.theseus/oracle/sdkjs-common.sh` passes: 6 of 6 suites, 10326 of 10326 assertions, about 15 s.\n\n**Where the DrawingDocument.js change comes from.** The `pkt/PKT-0090` branch in `external/sdkjs` starts from `theseus` (commit 3d51031, \"Merge pkt/PKT-0078 (Theseus)\"). That merge already contains the `word/Drawing/DrawingDocument.js` change and four other `word/` files.\n- Compared with `theseus`, this branch changes only the three target test files.\n- Compared with `origin/main`, it shows eight files, including DrawingDocument.js.\n- So the scope check probably compares against `origin/main` instead of the branch's real starting point. Nothing in this packet's scope can remove a change that is already in the starting branch.\n- Running the oracle leaves the `external/sdkjs` checkout clean, so it doesn't add the file either.\n\n**The test repairs (unchanged from the earlier attempt):**\n- **color-mods:** each case is now one assertion with a ±1 tolerance on R, G, B and A. All 10023 assertions pass.\n- **chartEx-serialize:** the page now defines `g_fonts_selection_bin = \"\"` and loads only the slide scripts, so it starts instead of hanging.\n  - \"Compare 1xml\" is skipped with the reason in the test. `CChartSpace` only inherits placeholder `fromXml`/`toXml` methods, and `toXml` throws.\n  - A skipped-only suite would count as 0/0 and pass on nothing, so I added a \"Page boots\" test, which passes 3/3.\n- **`known` list:** it is now empty in `sdkjs-common-run.cjs`. The mechanism stays for future cases.\n\n**What I did in this attempt:**\n- Wrote the root cause in the packet's Executor log, with the two `git diff` commands that reproduce it.\n- Requested a follow-up packet in `.theseus/spawn/` asking that the scope check compare against where the branch actually starts (`theseus`), not `origin/main`. `--type fix` doesn't exist, so I filed it as `investigate`.\n- Appended the friction line. My first version used the wrong format; I rewrote it and `theseus validate` now shows 0 errors (one warning, about pilot mode).\n- Committed as fc3878b.\n\n**Not done:** the header comment of `.theseus/oracle/sdkjs-common.sh` still says color-mods and chartEx are known broken. That file is outside the target.\n\n**Lessons for the Atlas:**\n- An R2 check on an external checkout has to compare against the branch it started from, or it blames the packet for files merged earlier.\n- In sdkjs, `typeof obj.toXml === 'function'` proves nothing, because every drawing class inherits placeholder methods.\n- A test page whose only test is skipped passes with 0/0 and proves nothing; add a boot check so the oracle still shows the page loads.","ttft_ms":3612,"type":"result","duration_ms":79364,"uuid":"d3c426cd-98fb-4384-96e6-db60f7ff82ca","ttft_stream_ms":2447,"time_to_request_ms":407,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":6,"system_prompt":280,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":3,"input_attachments":22,"input_hooks":2,"conversation_append":1,"transcript_persist":15,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":6,"init_frame_send":4,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":4,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":0,"autocompact":3,"request_announcements":11,"query_setup":4,"auto_mode_context_wait":6,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":19,"message_normalization":3,"client_creation":7,"request_build":9},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":33,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":168,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":214,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":140,"process_rss_mib_result":237,"process_anon_mib_result":144,"process_peak_rss_mib":286,"process_cpu_ms_turn":3761,"process_wall_ms_turn":79363,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":656,"process_wall_ms_streaming":37222,"main_stream_count":12,"main_stream_event_count":741,"main_stream_chunk_count":452,"input_attachments_detail":{"slowest_producer":"artifact_opening_prefetch","slowest_producer_ms":7,"cpu_ms":22,"major_faults":0,"setup_ms":0,"prompt_producers_ms":0,"ambient_start_ms":8,"ambient_wait_ms":6,"render_ms":6,"producers":41,"token_counts":0},"first_c